text:
{
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom, my name is Daniel. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Daniel, I am extremely upset. I just got my bill and I've been charged twice for my international roaming pack. My name is Fatima Reddy, my phone is 92620 50095, email is fatima.29@examplemail.com, and my address is 121 MG Road. If this isn't fixed, I am going to cancel my service and switch to another provider immediately.",
      "tags": [
        "churn_signal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I completely understand how frustrating it is to see double charges on your bill, Fatima. I would be upset too if that happened to me. Let me look into this for you right away.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Thank you. I've been a customer for years and this is just unacceptable. I need this money back.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I have pulled up your account for 121 MG Road. I can see the duplicate charge here. I am going to raise a refund request for the wrong charge of forty dollars right now to get this sorted for you.",
      "tags": [
        "action:refund_request"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Okay, thank you. When will I actually see that money back in my account? I need to know.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Please note that the refund request is subject to approval by our billing team, and once approved, it typically takes 7-10 business days to reflect in your account.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "7 to 10 business days? That's a bit long, and I really need this expedited. Is there any way to speed this up? I'm still quite concerned.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I understand. Since you need this expedited, what I can do is escalate this entire case directly to our senior billing supervisor team right now so they can review it immediately.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "That would be wonderful. I really appreciate you doing that for me, Daniel. That makes me feel much better.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "You are very welcome. I have successfully escalated the ticket to our supervisor team. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? Just to summarize, I've raised the refund request for the duplicate charge which is pending approval, and I've escalated this to our supervisors for priority processing. Thank you for your patience, and have a great day.",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "No, that's all I needed. Thank you so much for your help, Daniel. Goodbye!",
      "tags": []
    }
  ]
}
